    },
    {
      "text": "to win it there, it's like inertia going",
      "start": 546.32,
      "duration": 4.22
    },
    {
      "text": "the other way.",
      "start": 550.54,
      "duration": 1.06
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know.",
