      "start": 554.02,
      "duration": 1.36
    },
    {
      "text": "That's the beauty of football.",
      "start": 555.92,
      "duration": 1.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I saw a great Atalanta and now I'm",
      "start": 557.8,
      "duration": 3.54
    },
    {
      "text": "seeing a great Motte.",
      "start": 561.34,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
