      "duration": 4.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Because today only Motte beat Saricinesca.",
      "start": 607.63,
      "duration": 9.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Crazy.",
      "start": 617.82,
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "text": "Really this guy is amazing.",
      "start": 620.32,
      "duration": 3.62
    },
    {
      "text": "Incredible saves.",
      "start": 625.36,
      "duration": 1.2
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry for Dea because I think he",
